      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Supporting the mandate could boost your ethical brand and reassure pro-environment users, but it risks alienating 50% of your customer base claiming they \"don't want political opinions.\" Staying neutral avoids immediate political backlash and potential churn from conservative or undecided users, yet it likely deepens the perception that you are complicit in the violation the mandate aims to prevent. Ultimately, the decision hinges on whether your long-term brand identity is built on political activism or strictly on calculated neutrality.",
