      "content": "the \"complicit\" thing is what's worrying me. it feels like staying neutral is actually being seen as a stance in itself. if i'm being honest, most of our marketing is aimed at younger, more socially conscious people. if we stay neutral, aren't we basically just waiting for our brand to become irrelevant or seen as \"old school\" and uncaring?",
